  unitName: Phoenix Torque Ruby
  unitId: 10646
  unitNumber: 953
  description: A skilled sword fighter who once fought alongside the Oracle Knight.
    With new and improved arms to match her ever growing swordsmanship, Ruby enveloped
    her enemies in flames, cutting the gods down alongside her companions. Having
    very sharp senses due to her nature as a fox-person, she could sense every one
    of the gods' moves before anyone else. As the battle drew on, she used her body
    to shield the Oracle Knight, suffering a serious wound in the process. The outcome
    of this battle remains uncertain, and no records concerning Ruby have been found
    after this time.
  summonDesc: I would do anything for him. I mean, I love [[Oracle Knight Ark|him]]!
  fusionDesc: Can't you give me a bit more power? You see, there's lots of people
    I wanna protect!
  evoDesc: I've changed even more this time! Now any opponent I face stands no chance
    of winning!
  element: 1
  rarity: 6
